  "description": "Specialist BMW suspension specification across all generations of 3 Series, M3, M4 and M car platforms. Nitron systems specified around real BMW chassis behaviour.",
  "areaServed": "UK",
  "knowsAbout": ["BMW M3", "BMW M4", "BMW 3 Series", "E46 M3", "E90 M3", "F80 M3", "G80 M3", "Nitron R1", "Nitron R3", "Nitron elec-TRON"],
  "makesOffer": [
    {
